ap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="180" width="1520" x="200" y="1340" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band3-lb-arch" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#047857;" value="③ 插件 / 技能层 · Plugin &amp;amp; Skill Layer" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="420" x="216" y="1346" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-skill" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#064E3B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;" value="drawio-live Skill (Codex 版)\n路径: plugins/.../skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md\n含 agents/openai.yaml\n\n→ 指导模型: 规划 → 选形状 → 调工具 → 截图 → 修正 → 保存" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="120" width="420" x="280" y="1380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-skill" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE7F3;strokeColor=#EC4899;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#500724;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;" value="drawio-live Skill (Claude Code 版)\n路径: claude-code/skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md\n含 /drawio-live 触发器\n\n→ 指导模型: launch → status → add_shape → screenshot → save" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="120" width="420" x="1220" y="1380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="marketplace" parent="1" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#78350F;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" value=".claude-plugin/\n.marketplace.json\n\n（Codex Marketplace 配置）" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="100" width="120" x="900" y="1390" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band4-arch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="280" width="1520" x="200" y="1540" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band4-lb-arch" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#C2410C;" value="④ MCP 服务器层 · MCP Servers (Node.js 子进程)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="440" x="216" y="1546" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-live" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7C2D12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;" value="drawio-live (实时控制)\n入口: plugins/.../scripts/live-server.mjs\n\n工具 (12 个):\n• drawio_live_launch / status\n• drawio_live_add_shape / add_edge / draw_sequence\n• drawio_live_screenshot / inspect / update_cell\n• drawio_live_undo / redo / delete_cells / fit\n• drawio_live_search_shapes / save_snapshot\n• drawio_live_list_pages / add_page / switch_page / duplicate_cell / order_cell\n• 底层: shared.mjs + drawio-path.mjs" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="220" width="620" x="280" y="1580" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-utils" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7C2D12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;" value="drawio-file-utils (校验 / 导出)\n入口: plugins/.../scripts/server.mjs\n\n工具 (7 个):\n• drawio_validate — 检查 .drawio 结构\n• drawio_inspect — 列出 cell / edge 清单\n• drawio_update_cells — 改 label / style / 位置\n• drawio_export — 输出 PNG / SVG / PDF / JPG\n• drawio_create_diagram — 从结构化顶点生成图\n• drawio_create_trace_document — 嵌入参考图\n• drawio_write_xml — 直接写完整 XML\n• drawio_open — 在桌面端打开已存文件" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="220" width="620" x="1020" y="1580" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-callout" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#9A3412;fontStyle=2;" value="两台 MCP 服务器通过 stdio\n被宿主拉起,\n共享 shared.mjs 与 drawio-path.mjs" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="280" x="820" y="1810" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band5-arch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="240" width="1520" x="200" y="1840" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band5-lb-arch" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#B91C1C;" value="⑤ 桌面端 · draw.io Desktop (Electron App)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="440" x="216" y="1846" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-app" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7F1D1D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;" value="draw.io Desktop (Electron)\nPATH: D:\\Program Files\\draw.io\\draw.io.exe\n\n• 启动时带 --remote-debugging-port=9333\n• localhost 127.0.0.1:9333 暴露 graph API\n• 独立 profile: ~/.drawio-live-mcp/9333\n• 全部形状 / 连线 / 文字直接进入可视画布" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="180" width="900" x="280" y="1880" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-canvas" parent="1" style="shape=cloud;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FECACA;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7F1D1D;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" value="Visible Canvas\n（实时画布）\n\n100 ms – 1 s\n逐步出现" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="160" width="360" x="1280" y="1890" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-u-codex" edge="1" parent="1" source="user-arch" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1E3A8A;labelBackgroundColor=#EFF6FF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="codex-host" value="自然语言描述"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-u-claude" edge="1" parent="1" source="user-arch" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#1D